  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop a Vibrant, Competitive and Profitable Sierra Leonean Cocoa, Coffee and Cashew Economy, Driven by Private Supply Chain Actors Within a Regulatory Framework</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce poverty and food insecurity in Sierra Leone through better governance and improved household living conditions, as well as higher incomes. Solidaridad Network West Africa will bring its experience in partnering Cotton Tree Foundation the cash crop sector. Farmers will gain access to a package of production support services to be able to produce sustainable cocoa/coffee/cashew based needs whilst their farm experiences are profitable.</narrative>
  </description>
